  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TCPF: Support to operationalize the &quot;One Health Strategy 2019&quot; of the Government of Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide support for operationalization and institutionalization of &quot;One Health Strategy 2019&quot; through drafting of Action plans in alignment with the national OH strategy with agreed priorities and mechanisms; demonstrating, reviewing and documenting of the Action plans as national guidelines for OH operationalization; and drafting and endorsing of Sub-national OH strategy in selected provinces.</narrative>
  </description>
